  "description": "ITATED crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 2/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C134 H104 Dy8 N14 O76,6(C1 H4 O1),H2 O1,3.09(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3A (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4A (Dy) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 13 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.734-4.040 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 100.51-117.74°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy8(μ3-OH)4(ovn)2(mvn)2(p-NO2bz)14(CH3OH)2]·3.09CH3CN·6CH3OH·H2O (C146.18H139.27Dy8N17.09O83). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
